    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37275" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pōtātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		poto, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a drinking</i>, <i>toping</i>, <i>a
				drinking-bout</i>, <i>potation</i> (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prandium aut potatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Bacch. 1, 1, 46</span></i>
			: quosdam hesternā ex potatione oscitantes, Cic.
			Fragm. ap. <i><span class="en">Quint. 8, 3, 66</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">extrema,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 12, 4</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt.
				4, 1, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Stich. 1, 3, 58</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">diurnae potationes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 8, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
